sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Usuario as Usuario
    participant Frontend as Frontend (Next.js)
    participant Backend as Backend (Flask)
    participant Worker as Celery Worker
    participant ES as EvaluationService
    participant MinIO as MinIO (S3)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Usuario->>Frontend: Inicia evaluación
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/evaluations/datasets/{id}
    activate Backend
    Backend->>DB: Crea registro Evaluation (PENDING)
    Backend->>Worker: Encola tarea Celery (run_evaluation)
    Backend-->>Frontend: Devuelve {evaluation_id}
    deactivate Backend

    loop Polling (cada 2s)
        Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/evaluations/{id}/status
        Backend->>DB: Consulta estado
        DB-->>Backend: Retorna estado
        Backend-->>Frontend: Retorna estado (PENDING/RUNNING)
    end

    activate Worker
    Worker->>DB: Actualiza estado (RUNNING)
    Worker->>MinIO: Descarga dataset
    MinIO-->>Worker: Retorna CSV
    Worker->>ES: Invoca evaluate()
    activate ES
    ES->>ES: Ejecuta métricas configuradas
    ES->>ES: Calcula Quality Score
    ES->>ES: Compara con baseline
    ES->>ES: Evalúa Quality Gate
    ES-->>Worker: Retorna MetricResult
    deactivate ES
    Worker->>DB: Actualiza Evaluation y crea AnalysisRun (COMPLETED)
    deactivate Worker

    Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/evaluations/{id}/status
    Backend->>DB: Consulta estado
    DB-->>Backend: Retorna COMPLETED
    Backend-->>Frontend: Retorna estado (COMPLETED)
    Frontend->>Usuario: Redirige a página de resultados
